    "description": "Distance is sum of slot weight for unequal values OR either equal UNSEEN pair; known equal pairs contribute zero. Sort by distance then memory index. Vote uses every row in the first k distinct distance values, choosing (vote count,training prior,-class). Training selects k from [1,3,5,7,11] by leave-one-out hit count, first candidate on ties. Prediction confidence is winning votes/max(1,selected rows); explanation takes the nearest three winning-class memories from the entire sorted memory, not necessarily only voters."
